       whose published source must match what is on chain.
   (b) Versions of `@tabai/sdk` up to and including 0.2.0, and of
       `@tabai/agent-wallet-plugin` up to and including 0.1.1, were
       published to npm under the MIT License and remain under it. Later
       versions are released under this licence.
   (c) Third-party code, including everything under
       `packages/contracts/lib` and `apps/registry/vendor`, remains under
       the licence its authors chose.

